expect Tailscale
expect Off. Nothing reaches this reader over a tailnet.
expect-missing Status
expect-missing Refresh
expect-missing Address
clean
shot tailscale-off
# One switch. Nothing in the simulator starts a daemon, so the screen says it
# is starting and, after a minute of silence, that it has not.
tap-id toggle
wait-for Runs while Cobalt is open.
expect Starting
expect-missing Nothing reaches this reader
clean
shot tailscale-starting
tap About Tailscale
wait-for the private network between your own devices
expect kobo pair kobo
expect no exit node, no routes and no Tailscale SSH
expect BSD 3
clean
shot tailscale-about
# Signing out asks first, and Cancel returns to the page it was asked from.
tap Sign out
wait-for This reader forgets its key
clean
shot tailscale-sign-out
tap Cancel
wait-for the private network between your own devices
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Runs while Cobalt is open.
# The switch is kept across a restart.
restart
wait-for Runs while Cobalt is open.
expect-missing Nothing reaches this reader
wait 62000
wait-for Tailscale has not started.
expect Not started
expect Try again
clean
shot tailscale-not-started
tap-id toggle
wait-for Off. Nothing reaches this reader over a tailnet.
expect-missing Try again
